Package: healthsurveyportal
Title: Build-Time R Dependencies for the CanHealth 2024 Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Not an installable package. Declares the R packages needed to
    fetch and aggregate survey data at build time and to render the
    Shinylive (WebAssembly) dashboard. Install with
    `Rscript -e 'remotes::install_deps(dependencies = TRUE)'`.
    The browser-side app's packages (shiny, bslib, plotly) are fetched
    from the webR repository at runtime and need no local install, but are
    listed under Suggests so `shiny::runApp("app")` works for local testing.
License: Internal project, not for distribution
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    DBI,
    dbplyr,
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    odbc,
    quarto,
    rlang,
    shinylive
Suggests:
    arrow,
    bslib,
    plotly,
    shiny,
    testthat
